{"path":"utility/basic_stacktrace/swap","title":"std::basic_stacktrace<Allocator>::swap","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_stacktrace&lt;Allocator&gt;::</span>swap","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/basic_stacktrace/swap","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"Exchanges the contents of the container with those of other. Does not invoke any move, copy, or swap operations on individual stacktrace_entry objects.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> swap<span class=\"br0\">(</span> basic_stacktrace<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"coMULTI\">/* see below */</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Exchanges the contents of the container with those of <code>other</code>. Does not invoke any move, copy, or swap operations on individual <code>stacktrace_entry</code> objects.\n</p><p>All iterators and references remain valid. The <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/basic_stacktrace/end\"><code>end()</code></a> iterator is invalidated.\n</p><p>If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/allocator_traits\"><span class=\"kw705\">std::<span class=\"me2\">allocator_traits</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>allocator_type<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">propagate_on_container_swap</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">value</span></span></code> is true, then the allocators are exchanged using an unqualified call to non-member <code>swap</code>. Otherwise, they are not swapped (and if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">get_allocator<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> other.<span class=\"me1\">get_allocator</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>, the behavior is undefined).\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td>  other\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td>  <code>basic_stacktrace</code> to exchange the contents with\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<div class=\"t-noexcept-full\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/language/noexcept_spec\"><code>noexcept</code></a> specification:&nbsp;&nbsp;\n<div class=\"t-noexcept-box\"><span class=\"t-cc\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/allocator_traits\"><span class=\"kw705\">std::<span class=\"me2\">allocator_traits</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Allocator<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">propagate_on_container_swap</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">value</span><br>\n<span class=\"sy3\">||</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/allocator_traits\"><span class=\"kw705\">std::<span class=\"me2\">allocator_traits</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Allocator<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">is_always_equal</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">value</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></span></div></div>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Constant.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/basic_stacktrace/swap2\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>std::swap<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">(std::basic_stacktrace)</span></span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(C++23)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  specializes the <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/swap\">std::swap</a></span> algorithm <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"},{"path":"utility/basic_stacktrace","title":"std::basic_stacktrace"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_stacktrace<Allocator>::swap","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++23. Exchanges the contents of the container with those of other."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"other"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Exceptions"},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Constant."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"std::swap(std::basic_stacktrace)","note":"specializes the std::swap algorithm"}]}]},"standards":["C++23"],"wordCount":111,"codeBlockCount":0}
